---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SectionContactCta from "../components/common/SectionContactCta.astro";

const title = "Terms of Service";
const description =
  "Review the terms and conditions for using the BusinessCompany website and contacting BusinessCompany Solutions Inc. for business IT services.";
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonicalPath={Astro.url.pathname}
  noFrenchAlternate={true}
  disabledLanguages={["fr"]}
>
  <article class="blog-post">
    <div class="container">
      <a class="blog-post__back" href="/">Back to home</a>

      <header class="blog-post__header">
        <div class="blog-post__meta">
          <span>Terms of Service</span>
          <span>Last updated: July 2026</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="blog-post__title">Terms of Service</h1>

        <p class="blog-post__description">
          These Terms of Service outline the general conditions for using the BusinessCompany website,
          contacting our team, and requesting information about our business IT services.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="blog-post__content">
        <h2>1. Acceptance of these terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using this website, you agree to these Terms of Service. If you do
          not agree with these terms, please do not use this website.
        </p>

        <p>
          These terms apply to general website use. Any managed IT services, cybersecurity
          services, Microsoft 365 support, backup services, infrastructure work, consulting,
          or project work may be governed by a separate agreement, statement of work, proposal,
          or service contract.
        </p>

        <h2>2. About BusinessCompany</h2>
        <p>
          BusinessCompany Solutions Inc. provides business IT support, managed IT services,
          cybersecurity services, Microsoft 365 and cloud support, backup and disaster
          recovery services, network infrastructure support, and IT consulting.
        </p>

        <p>
          Information on this website is provided for general business and informational
          purposes only. It does not create a client relationship, service agreement, or
          guaranteed support obligation unless confirmed through a separate written agreement.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Website use</h2>
        <p>
          You agree to use this website only for lawful purposes and in a way that does not
          interfere with the security, availability, or proper operation of the website.
        </p>

        <p>You agree not to:</p>

        <ul>
          <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to the website, systems, or related services.</li>
          <li>Use the website to transmit malicious code, spam, or harmful content.</li>
          <li>Copy, scrape, or misuse website content without permission.</li>
          <li>Submit false, misleading, or unauthorized information through website forms.</li>
          <li>Use the website in a way that may damage BusinessCompany, its clients, or third parties.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Contact forms and submitted information</h2>
        <p>
          When you submit a contact form or communicate with BusinessCompany, you agree that the
          information you provide is accurate and that you are authorized to share it.
        </p>

        <p>
          Submitting a form does not guarantee acceptance of work, immediate support, or a
          specific response time. For urgent support, please use the appropriate phone number
          or support process provided by BusinessCompany.
        </p>

        <h2>5. No emergency guarantee through website forms</h2>
        <p>
          Website forms and general email enquiries should not be used for critical emergency
          support requests unless you have been instructed to do so by BusinessCompany.
        </p>

        <p>
          Existing clients should follow their established support process for urgent issues,
          outages, cybersecurity incidents, or after-hours support.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Service information</h2>
        <p>
          The information on this website is intended to describe BusinessCompany’s general service
          areas. Specific services, pricing, timelines, availability, deliverables, and
          responsibilities may vary depending on the client environment and agreed scope of
          work.
        </p>

        <p>
          Any proposal, quote, statement of work, service agreement, or contract provided by
          BusinessCompany will take precedence over general website content.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Third-party tools and vendors</h2>
        <p>
          Some IT services may involve third-party software, platforms, vendors, cloud
          services, hardware, licensing, or support providers. Third-party products and
          services are subject to their own terms, conditions, warranties, support limits, and
          availability.
        </p>

        <p>
          BusinessCompany is not responsible for third-party outages, licensing changes, vendor
          restrictions, platform limitations, or service interruptions outside of BusinessCompany’s
          reasonable control.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Website content</h2>
        <p>
          We make reasonable efforts to keep website content accurate and up to date, but we
          do not guarantee that all information is complete, current, or error-free.
        </p>

        <p>
          BusinessCompany may update, remove, or change website content at any time without notice.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          Website content, design, text, graphics, logos, images, icons, and other materials
          are owned by or licensed to BusinessCompany Solutions Inc. unless otherwise stated.
        </p>

        <p>
          You may not copy, reproduce, modify, distribute, or use website materials for
          commercial purposes without written permission from BusinessCompany.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Links to other websites</h2>
        <p>
          This website may include links to third-party websites or services. These links are
          provided for convenience only.
        </p>

        <p>
          BusinessCompany is not responsible for the content, security, privacy practices, accuracy, or
          availability of third-party websites.
        </p>

        <h2>11. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          This website is provided on an “as available” basis. BusinessCompany is not liable for any
          loss, damage, interruption, or issue resulting from use of this website or reliance
          on general website information.
        </p>

        <p>
          Nothing on this website should be treated as a substitute for a formal assessment,
          written recommendation, signed agreement, or professional review of your specific IT
          environment.
        </p>

        <h2>12. Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Use of this website may involve the collection and handling of information as
          described in our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>13. Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p>
          BusinessCompany may update these Terms of Service from time to time. The updated version will
          be posted on this page with a revised “Last updated” date.
        </p>

        <p>
          Continued use of the website after changes are posted means you accept the updated
          terms.
        </p>

        <h2>14. Contact us</h2>
        <p>
          For questions about these Terms of Service, contact BusinessCompany Solutions Inc.
        </p>

        <p>
          <strong>BusinessCompany Solutions Inc.</strong><br />
          Company Address, Cambridge, ON N3H 4R7<br />
          Email: <a href="mailto:hello@BusinessCompany.ca">hello@BusinessCompany.ca</a><br />
          Phone: <a href="tel:5192676767">111-111-1111</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <SectionContactCta />
</BaseLayout>